  {
    "id": "p_change",
    "template": "算了，我要 [数量][量词][东西]",
    "pinyin": "suànle, wǒ yào [数量][量词][东西]",
    "en": "Forget it, I want [数量] [量词] of [东西]",
    "day": 5,
    "group": "点菜",
    "speaker": "customer",
    "why": "算了 cancels what came before: only what follows counts. In your script, a 听到 \"我要…\" rule also hears this sentence, so put the 算了 rule first and the plain 我要 rule under its 不然. Then only one of them runs."
  },
